# The skill files are installed by a raw byte copy (install.ps1 Copy-Item) and
# their quoted command lines are parsed by test/skills.test.ts. With git's
# Windows default (`core.autocrlf=true`) and no rule here, the same committed
# blob materialises as CRLF on a Windows checkout — so what gets installed (and
# tested) differs by platform from what the repository records. Pin to LF.
.github/skills/** text eol=lf
